# Two Ketra soldiers of one clan (KetraOrcSupport) and a Ketra ally of level 1: the ally hits the
# footman, whose clan call reaches the grunt and itself, and each wants to petrify the ally (Raid
# Curse, 4515): the footman by its attacked and its clan attacked hooks, the grunt by its clan
# attacked hook alone. The footman forgets the hit, and no behavior script is bound, so neither
# soldier wants to attack the ally back. Each soldier lists the curse, which a scenario monster
# needs to cast it; the cast itself is alliance_support_see_spell.scenario (two casts of one AI tick
# have no fixed order). Expectations are derived from the reference source (onAttacked,
# onClanAttacked).
character Ally 40
standing 1
script script.feature.KetraOrcSupport
npc footman 21324 Monster 40 0 0 clan ketra_orc_clan 300 skill DEBUFF 4515 1
npc grunt 21325 Monster 60 0 0 clan ketra_orc_clan 300 skill DEBUFF 4515 1

hit footman 10
  desires footman cast(player,4515,move)=2000000
  desires grunt cast(player,4515,move)=1000000
  hate footman 0
